OL,3,ASaudi minister vows 'serious response'
OL,4,Ato Houthi attacks on airports
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaudi Arabia's energy minister has
OL,7,Fvowed a "serious" response to the
OL,8,Fdeadly attacks on the kingdom's
OL,9,Fairports and oil and gas facilities by
OL,10,FYemen's Iran-backed Houthi movement.
OL,12,F"The events of recent weeks are
OL,13,Fserious. Our response must be equally
OL,14,Fserious," Prince Abdul Aziz bin Salman
OL,15,Ftold the WPC Energy Congress in Riyadh.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
