OL,3,ATrump faces growing backlash over plans
OL,4,Ato import diesel from Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump is facing a
OL,7,Fgrowing backlash over plans to import
OL,8,Fdiesel from Russia as the Iran war
OL,9,Fcontinues to impact global energy
OL,10,Fprices.
OL,12,FTrump on Friday announced that Russian
OL,13,FPresident Vladimir Putin had agreed to
OL,14,Frelease 300,000 tonnes of diesel
OL,15,Fimmediately "to the American and global
OL,16,Fmarketplace" followed by several other
OL,17,Fshipments.
OL,19,FThat is despite signing legislation to
OL,20,Fauthorise fresh US sanctions and
OL,21,Ftariffs on nations that import Russian
OL,22,Foil and gas just weeks ago.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
